  "provenance": {
    "type": "spec",
    "note": "Derived from the cited clauses and the planted data. By IDX-MTH-4 with 1024 dimensions, the term of the query has the bucket 865, and no term of the bound text has this bucket. Thus the score comes only from the text behind the removed object."
